Commit:     Dongkyun Son <dongkyun.s@samsung.com>
CommitDate: Fri Oct 16 11:13:11 2026 +0900

    Revert clang bootstrap + ThinLTO, fall back to GCC
    
    The clang bootstrap + ThinLTO optimization (7e4dc62) caused severe build
    time regression on x86_64 because -fno-inline-functions from project.conf
    disables all function inlining in clang, unlike GCC.
    
    Revert to the original GCC-based build by undoing:
    - 7e4dc62d8ac0 (optimize llvm performance: clang, -O3, ThinLTO)
    - cb67996861d0 (remove -fno-inline-functions)
    - 67619ec8bbba (fix llvm-static-devel with ThinLTO: native archive conversion)
    
    Change-Id: Ib6ff9acd34c042b88ba6f74ee7d29950d1107c0d

